{"sourceUrl":"https://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1013/2892.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:47.781532+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1013/2892.htm","html":"<div>\n<h5>电信学部微电子学院2026年（第七届）全国优秀大学生夏令营通知</h5>\n<h6>日期：2026-05-28    点击数：    来源：\r\n    </h6>\n\n\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span>    为了促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，</span></span><span><span>西安交通大学</span></span><span><span>电子与信息学部微电子学院</span></span><span><span>将于</span></span><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>上旬</span></span></strong><span><span>举办</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>微电子学院</span></span><span><span>优秀大学生暑</span></span><span><span>期</span></span><span><span>夏令营</span><span>”活动，旨</span></span><span><span>在搭建学院与学生交流互动</span></span><span><span>平台，使学生</span></span><span><span>充分</span></span><span><span>了解</span></span><span><span>微电子学院</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>欢迎有意向的同学积极报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>     <span>一、活动形式及时间</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>    1</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>线上举办，详情参见后续通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    2</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>活动时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>上旬</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>     <span>二、活动内容</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>    1、学院介绍：学院历史、学科简介，人才培养、教学及科研等情况介绍</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    2、专题宣讲：各科研方向负责人介绍研究内容、专业实验室情况和研究生就业去向等，加深对相关专业情况的了解。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>     <span>三、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>    1、申请者应是集成电路科学与工程、电子科技与技术相关专业202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    2、所在学校为双一流大学建设高校，或所在专业在最新一轮学科评估中排名B+及以上学科；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    3、综合成绩排名在专业前20%；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    4、</span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    5、鼓励符合条件的本校微电子相关专业同学积极报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>    <span>四、申请流程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>   </span></span><strong><span><span> 1、报名时间</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>6月</span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>日</span>-6月1</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>    2、注册</span></span><span><span>填报：登录西安交通大学夏令营报名系统（</span><a href=\"http://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn/</a>），</span><span><span>报名项目</span></span><span><span>选择</span></span><span><span>“全国优秀大学生夏令营”，</span></span><span><span>注册获取报名号，用报名号登录系统，认真填写相关信息后</span></span><span><span>并上传材料后，</span></span><span><span>保存提交。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    3、上传材料：请申请者在网申系统提交以下申请材料的彩色扫描件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    1）个人简历（按A4排版不超过一页）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    2）加盖申请人所在学校/院教务处公章的截止目前的本科正式成绩单；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    3</span></span><span><span>）相关证明材料，如大学英语六级、</span><span>TOEFL/GRE等英语考试成绩单，论文、专利等学术成果，课外学术科技活动获奖证书及其他相关证书</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>请提供相应证明文件</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>    请将申请材料按以上顺序合成为一个文件后以</span><span>PDF格式上传，命名格式：本科学校-报名专业方向-报名号-姓名。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>   </span></span></strong><span><span> <span><span>4、材料审核：学院于6月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日前组织专家对报名材料进行审核。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   </span></span><strong><span><span> 5、学生确认：入营学员于6月</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>日前在报名端确认是否参加，逾期不确认者视为放弃。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>    6</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>名单公示：入营名单将在微电子学院官网通知公告栏公布。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>     <span>特别说明：系统报名，无需邮寄纸质材料！</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>    五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、注意事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>    1</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>未在规定时间内审核确认者视为自动放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    2</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>学生应全程参加夏令营各项活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    3</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>如果发现材料弄虚作假，学院将取消或者追回夏令营活动中获得的权益，并保留追诉的权利。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    4</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>未能参加夏令营的同学，仍可参加学院后期的</span></span><span><span>推免相关招生活动</span></span><span><span>报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>     六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>    联系人：田老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    办公电话：</span><span>029-82663426</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    邮箱：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:ele@xjtu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ele@xjtu.edu.cn</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    学院主页：</span><span><a href=\"http://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    其他未尽事宜，由微电子学院负责解释执行。 </span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>西安交通大学</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电信学部微电子学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>5月</span></span><span><span>28</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n\n<div></div>\n<b></b>\n<div>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p> <span>下一条：</span><a href=\"https://ele.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1013/2872.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">西安交通大学微电子学院2026年博士招生秋季资格考核拟录取名单公示</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>【<a>关闭</a>】</p>\n</div>","textSha256":"f66d26ca107e440e52c1f99b05386d329ebaa907523fa4598b03cecbe9ba7136","textLength":1189,"sourceSha256":"5b62b593842dae18639bb0139f07cee079bc5106779f970891ef2229b3335e4b","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a9fbdb53241735256b81","title":"2026年西安交通大学电子与信息学部微电子学院2026年（第七届）全国优秀大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:47.781532+00:00"}
